   "y": 727
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "FREE SKILLS",
   "font": "geistMono",
   "size": "11px",
   "weight": "500",
   "lh": "14.85px",
   "ls": "1.32px",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.6)",
   "tt": "uppercase",
   "w": 169,
   "y": 727
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "A lot of people think the rules of software development are being rewritten by AI. They th",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "17.5px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "29.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.72)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 679,
   "y": 890
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Coding agents like Claude Code and Codex ship code faster than any human ever has. But wit",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "17.5px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "29.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.72)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 679,
   "y": 969
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "If you can design codebases agents love, you can reap the rewards of this new era. AI Hero",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "17.5px",
   "weight": "500",
   "lh": "29.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.72)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 679,
   "y": 1077
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Every skill here is free, installs in one command, and you can use it today. Start anywher",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "17.5px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "29.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.6)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 672,
   "y": 1393
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Set up once, then find your way around.",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "14px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "22.75px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.6)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 395,
   "y": 1560
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The idea→ship spine, in order.",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "14px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "22.75px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.6)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 395,
   "y": 1560
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Explore an open question and produce a decision/answer that feeds the flow.",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "14px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "22.75px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.6)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 395,
   "y": 1560
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Keep the codebase and issue list healthy; generates work for the flow.",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "14px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "22.75px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.6)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 395,
   "y": 1806
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Human-facing workflows you run, not about code.",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "14px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "22.75px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.6)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 395,
   "y": 1806
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "The reusable layer other skills invoke or cite.",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "14px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "22.75px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.6)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 395,
   "y": 1806
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Most developers find the gap is further back than they expected. Pick the honest one.",
   "font": "geist",
   "size": "17.5px",
   "weight": "400",
   "lh": "29.4px",
   "ls": "normal",
   "color": "rgba(244, 243, 241, 0.6)",
   "tt": "none",
   "w": 504,
